{"id":"d_counseling_guilty_mightybunny_06","cat":"counsel","group":{"id":"char5182","label":"Guilty: Mighty Bunny"},"label":"Advising Guilty: Mighty Bunny: 06","stage":null,"prev":"d_counseling_guilty_mightybunny_05","next":"d_counseling_guilty_mightybunny_07","speakers":{"guilty_b":"Guilty"},"icons":{"guilty_b":"si_c404_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"d_counseling_guilty_mightybunny_06_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"guilty_b","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_guilty_mightybunny_06_1","text":"I wanted to become the perfect bunny girl for you, so I looked up some information about bunnies...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"CoinRushMainHall","bgArt":"coinrushmainhall","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_backtonormal","movie":null,"shown":["guilty_b"],"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_guilty_mightybunny_06_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"guilty_b","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_guilty_mightybunny_06_2","text":"I learned that they're more ferocious than they seem.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_guilty_mightybunny_06_3","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_guilty_mightybunny_06_3","text":"How so?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_guilty_mightybunny_06_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"guilty_b","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_guilty_mightybunny_06_4","text":"Bunnies are extremely weak. Out in the wild, they're low on the food chain, meaning they're everyone's prey...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_guilty_mightybunny_06_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"guilty_b","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_guilty_mightybunny_06_5","text":"So, apparently, they think the best way to defend themselves is through fierce expressions of anger and savage attacks...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_guilty_mightybunny_06_6","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_guilty_mightybunny_06_6","text":"Reminds me of you, Guilty.","jump":"d_counseling_guilty_mightybunny_06_8","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_100"},{"id":"d_counseling_guilty_mightybunny_06_7","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_guilty_mightybunny_06_7","text":"That doesn't sound like you at all, Guilty.","jump":"d_counseling_guilty_mightybunny_06_12","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_120"},{"id":"d_counseling_guilty_mightybunny_06_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"guilty_b","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_guilty_mightybunny_06_8","text":"...?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_guilty_mightybunny_06_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"guilty_b","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_guilty_mightybunny_06_9","text":"In what way...? Unlike rabbits, I'm strong and powerful, so what exactly about them reminds you of me...?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_guilty_mightybunny_06_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"guilty_b","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_guilty_mightybunny_06_10","text":"Wait, are you trying to say I'm savage and ferocious...?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_guilty_mightybunny_06_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"guilty_b","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_guilty_mightybunny_06_11","text":"Counselor...","jump":"d_counseling_guilty_mightybunny_06_16","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_guilty_mightybunny_06_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"guilty_b","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_guilty_mightybunny_06_12","text":"Yeah, I know... I'm just too strong. Maybe being a bunny girl just doesn't suit me...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_guilty_mightybunny_06_13","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_guilty_mightybunny_06_13","text":"No, you're the best bunny girl, Guilty.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_guilty_mightybunny_06_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"guilty_b","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_guilty_mightybunny_06_14","text":"Really...? You think so?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_guilty_mightybunny_06_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"guilty_b","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_guilty_mightybunny_06_15","text":"Hehe... That makes me happy...","jump":"d_counseling_guilty_mightybunny_06_16","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_guilty_mightybunny_06_16","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_guilty_mightybunny_06_16","text":"Guilty and I talk in depth about rabbits.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"none","bgArt":"none","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"}]}